Switch contracts
- AP:
    kernel=closed-boundary endpoint kernel
    retain=endpoint zero-credit pairs plus Kaczynski approach class
    forbidden_forgetting=open-measure averaging or raw Fejer negativity
- GW 12->24:
    kernel=closed-boundary endpoint kernel
    retain=endpoint zero-credit pairs plus Kaczynski approach class
    forbidden_forgetting=open-measure averaging or raw Fejer negativity
- covering 12->84:
    kernel=multi-chart lift / boundary-moment kernel
    retain=lift chart, endpoint owners, exact safe mass, late q label
    forbidden_forgetting=squarefree mu^2/phi collapse of repeated-prime q
- covering 6->98:
